    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d589">

                <pb facs="0488" n="476" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg476"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00112 European War 1939/6271: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Spain</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hayes</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-08-14T19:00:00-04:00">August 14, 1942—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>738. Your 1029, August 5. As General Orgaz has kept Madrid Government informed of
                    all developments, Department has not considered it necessary to discuss with
                    Spanish Embassy here question of separate economic agreement for Spanish North
                    Africa. Do you have any special reason to believe that such discussion would be
                    advisable?</p>
                <p>Repeated to Tangier.<anchor n="49" xml:id="d589-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
